# Judge2-2-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL12
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:被害人是佐伯米莉亚。<br>她的尸体是在上锁的<br>惩罚室里被发现的，<br>当时她被绑在<br>十字架上。|#0102Trial02_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:68,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default,ArmR8_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Downcast_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:米莉亚小姐的<br>尸体上<br>有多处刺伤……|#0102Trial02_Meruru001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

; ＠備考◆後半、詰まるような震え声で
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Cry,ArmR8_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Cry_Closed1,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我稍微检查了一下……<br>她的伤口血肉模糊，<br>不知道被刺了<br>多少刀……|#0102Trial02_Meruru002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR3,ArmL12,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我请梅露露帮忙<br>做了验尸的工作！<br>非常感谢你的帮助！|#0102Trial02_Sherry002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:65,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Fearful1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR7,ArmL6,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Fearful_Open,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……这种事有必要<br>笑着说吗。|#0102Trial02_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL12,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"总而言之，<br>被绑在<link=\"Objection_01_02_02_01\">惩罚室</link>里的<link=\"Objection_01_02_02_02\">米莉亚</link><br>受到凶手<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_02_03\">多次戳刺腹部，因而遇害</link>。<br>以上就是案发经过～！|#0102Trial02_Sherry003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:65,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:那请问凶器<br>是什么？|#0102Trial02_Margo001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open03
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"是<link=\"Objection_01_02_02_04\">扎在胸口上的小刀</link>吧。<br>可能是<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_02_05\">惩罚室的备用品</link>！<br>|#0102Trial02_Sherry004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:65,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Neutral_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……据说只要刀具<br>足够锋利，<br>被切到都没有感觉。|#0102Trial02_Margo002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:反过来说，<br>如果用这种<br>破破烂烂的<br>刀具……|#0102Trial02_Margo003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR3,ArmL12,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:就能给对方带来疼痛，<br>并有效地进行拷问……<br>对吧！|#0102Trial02_Sherry005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:65,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:没错♡|#0102Trial02_Margo004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,ArmR4,ArmL6,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:这种恶趣味小研究<br>有什么必要拿出来讲吗……！|#0102Trial02_Alisa002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:65,50 Roll:4

